        <dc:title>Sixes Wild: Echoes</dc:title>
        <dc:creator opf:file-as="O'Kun, Tempe" opf:role="aut">O'Kun, Tempe</dc:creator>
        <dc:contributor opf:file-as="calibre" opf:role="bkp">calibre (3.42.0) [https://calibre-ebook.com]</dc:contributor>
        <dc:date>2016-06-18T21:29:16.044866+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:description>Life's not all whiskey and revelry for this bunny gunslinger. In a recent tangle, Six had cause to dynamite a lion crime lord in his silver mine. The kitty had the nerve to survive and vanish with one of the guns tied to her dead father's spirit. A sensible hare would go to ground, lying low while she tracked down the varmint. And that's just what she'd do, had she not stumbled into love with the local fruit bat sheriff. Love's all well and good, but courting a gentleman when you're no proper lady is a challenge Six never thought she would have to tackle.All told, Frontier life is enough to trounce anybody. But then, Six Shooter has never been just any bunny.</dc:description>
